WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:05.964
♪♪

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:07.257
Emily:
3-2-1.

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:10.052
Good evening, 
I'm, Emily Dickinson.

00:00:10.052 --> 00:00:12.512
♪♪

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:16.099
Hailee:
Using Emily Dickinson's poetry
as a-a starting point

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:20.604
for anything creative, results
in pure wildness.

00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:25.484
Alena:
My goal with this series is
always to be using the

00:00:25.484 --> 00:00:30.405
life and work of Emily Dickinson, 
as a kind of fun house mirror for what we

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:32.824
are going through 
as people today.

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:34.618
A quiet night in, baby.

00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:35.994
Novels and chill.

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:37.120
♪♪

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.705
Hailee:
After season one, Emily

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:40.832
can call herself a writer.

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:42.542
You really are a poet.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:47.422
Hailee:
With season two, the changing
pace of media and technology

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:51.843
Hailee:
that sort of lead to this
explosion of celebrity culture

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:54.471
is what I was really excited to dig into.

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:56.556
This is a crazy time to be alive.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:57.933
Why do things have to change?

00:00:57.933 --> 00:01:00.185
Alena: This season really revolves around

00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:03.230
Emily's struggle with whether or
not she wants to become famous.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:05.315
You deserve to be seen, Emily.

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:07.985
Hailee: After season one, Sue has
transformed into 

00:01:07.985 --> 00:01:09.861
this glamorous socialite.

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:11.029
♪♪

00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:13.407
Hailee: She's having these 
outrageous parties

00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:16.451
Hailee:
and she's, you know suddenly
wearing these gorgeous gowns

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:18.704
Hailee:
and she's this new sort of
person.

00:01:18.704 --> 00:01:21.331
I already told you, it's not the
right look for tonight.

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:22.332
And besides...

00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:24.501
-Yeah.
I can't be seen in the same
dress twice.

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:27.254
Hailee:
Emily is kind of caught in the
web of it all.

00:01:27.254 --> 00:01:31.258
She also isn't sure if Sue's
intentions are pure.

00:01:31.258 --> 00:01:34.886
Sam, I'd like you to meet my
sister-in-law.

00:01:34.886 --> 00:01:36.596
Emily Dickinson.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:40.392
Alena: Sam Bowles, the young, ambitious,

00:01:40.392 --> 00:01:42.352
Alena:
progressive newspaper editor,

00:01:42.352 --> 00:01:44.313
comes barreling into their lives.

00:01:44.313 --> 00:01:45.314
You're interesting.

00:01:45.314 --> 00:01:46.565
♪♪

00:01:46.565 --> 00:01:47.566
I'm interested.

00:01:47.566 --> 00:01:49.401
Hailee: Part of her wants to be famous
and another part of her

00:01:49.401 --> 00:01:51.278
Hailee:
is really scared by it.

00:01:51.278 --> 00:01:54.156
This is where you will go.

00:01:54.156 --> 00:01:56.616
Aa, I-I, I don't know.

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.368
Alena: I'm really excited 

00:01:58.368 --> 00:02:02.789
Alena:
for the audience to get to come
back home to these characters.

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:03.874
-I'll miss you
-I'll miss you too.

00:02:03.874 --> 00:02:06.418
But find that home has changed.

00:02:06.418 --> 00:02:08.170
Alena:
We get to stretch our wings and

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:09.463
Alena:
expand our world.

00:02:09.463 --> 00:02:11.548
♪♪

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:13.842
Hailee: This season takes you to places
that you 

00:02:13.842 --> 00:02:14.926
Hailee:
would never expect.

00:02:14.926 --> 00:02:16.219
(Both)
Laughing.

00:02:16.219 --> 00:02:18.805
Hailee:
Parties, unrequited love, a
séance.

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:20.182
(Thunder)
(screams)

00:02:20.182 --> 00:02:22.392
Hailee: It's more sophisticated 
and it's sexier

00:02:22.392 --> 00:02:23.769
Hailee:
and it's more mature.

00:02:23.769 --> 00:02:25.771
Hailee:
It's about self discovery

00:02:25.771 --> 00:02:28.732
and growth and fame and the
dangers of fame

00:02:28.732 --> 00:02:30.150
Hailee:
in the 1800s - 

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.235
Hailee:
all through a modern lens.

00:02:32.235 --> 00:02:34.029
Sam:
This is it.

00:02:34.029 --> 00:02:35.530
You ready?

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:36.531
Emily:
I hope so.

00:02:36.531 --> 00:02:37.991
♪♪

